EmitBranchJoinModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: EmitBranchJoin — non-loop Branch emission (isLoop=false)

    Function
        Name: EmitBranchJoin
        Params: state, b, term, join
        Returns: state

    DependsOn
        EmitInstrs, EmitCond, EmitBlock, CommonJoin, Push, PushList

    Reads
        b["instrs"], term["cond"], term["true"], term["false"], state["labels"]

    Writes
        state["out"], state["labels"]

    Behavior
        Emits the if/else structure: BLOCK, instrs, EmitCond, IF, EmitBlock(true), br 0, ELSE, EmitBlock(false), br 0, END, END, labels restore, EmitBlock(join)

    Notes
        Matches the isLoop=false path in emit_block
